#: a3d380642f4f412ea0d116b605f52a4b e20986f986ac49b1bc3a8b74fae8642b
#: f5a3472f0adb42868bc0a0e311e1e1cd
msgid "SDA: Bi-directional Data, connects to peripherals SDA pin"
msgstr "SDA：双向数据，连接到外设的 SDA 引脚"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flight-controller-io.rst:88
#: 4985e5e23bc34c66b0d41d2c86115d1d 54e86b4f114549c5a1829246e4b0e4f1
#: 8b7018786f94409bafb2d39f779ff5a4 af816b5ccb3b463097fc473d5b917c28
#: f61b7707f89e4912979838f5a9c26c82
msgid ""
"While I2C uses 3.3V signaling, often +5V is supplied in the connector along "
"with the signals, since many I2C devices actually use this as main power. If"
" not enough ports are provided, I2C expansion boards can allow more than one"
" device to be connected."
msgstr ""
"虽然 I2C 使用 3.3V 信号，但连接器中通常同时提供 +5V，因为许多 I2C 设备将其用作主电源。如果端口不够用，I2C "
"扩展板可以允许连接多个设备。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flight-controller-io.rst:90
#: 132f12ac83e24b46863e5276d38f2304 23e64c55a0b74940807d09d4f083f358
#: 5a7b3050139f4229a3ba98b3f8391b64 70aab84f8dd8461ba0ba838d247ea192
#: fc66938db9b84e51a7be8e34cf75cb3c
msgid ""
"Some board-level autopilots require external 2K ohm pullups on the signal "
"lines to 3.3V since they are not provided on the board, while some I2C "
"peripherals provide the pull-ups. If the device does not operate properly, "
"one should first be sure that the pull-ups are provided somewhere."
msgstr ""
"某些板卡级飞控要求在信号线上外接 2K 欧姆上拉电阻到 3.3V（因为板卡上未提供），而某些 I2C "
"外设自带上拉电阻。如果设备工作不正常，应首先确认上拉电阻是否已在某处提供。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flight-controller-io.rst:93
#: 2c283647388c41789bd3b2765753d8cf 3fb8bb4dd93144de92ce9530e047e081
#: c165d5ecdbc34a8eb189e4dface9a666 d713603bac0348fe88710fbfde33aaab
#: e34fdae0344d45459b237eacacadbba6
msgid "GPS"
msgstr "GPS"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flight-controller-io.rst:95
#: 11ef2983154040ab8204a8a76e3b2d0f 40d7719b23524390925672591272e504
#: 46a23e5b23124c97909e7ff745deb75e 5c3aea7f57f04fadb2cc73807d550f20
#: 97cd788fd72e4c8a832f1c42d9364252
msgid ""
":ref:`GPS<common-positioning-landing-page>` is usually attached to one of "
"the UART ports, but some autopilots provide a connector dedicated to GPS "
"and/or GPS/Compass which includes the I2C signals."
msgstr ""
":ref:`GPS<common-positioning-landing-page>` 通常连接到某个 UART 端口，但部分飞控提供专用的 GPS "
"和/或 GPS/罗盘连接器，其中包含 I2C 信号。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flight-controller-io.rst:100
#: 4936a0bdfffe413da78c88f5c7397034 730674952e7c4b4a9c3e688aa556784d
#: 7d1b54245ca64bfb920bd925d7db42b6 86b50927b2ea4b4fa94e340e5aa3cf3d
#: a17798194b7a4b36b2f5bd6f7c97421f
msgid "TX: Data Output, connected to the GPS RX input"
msgstr "TX：数据输出，连接到 GPS 的 RX 输入"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flight-controller-io.rst:101
#: 7980eb54983946c4a4f5ba75928e3ce6 93630d279174442fa2a67284168802d9
#: b05db98165404ac6a3752cb2e10cf06e c89f54fce2ef4716ac4358c55878a121
#: f817d4eb0923406da922f692fa237b17
msgid "RX: Data Input, connected to the GPS TX output"
msgstr "RX：数据输入，连接到 GPS 的 TX 输出"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flight-controller-io.rst:103
#: 0c4d9f0bfa4d44ebabfc9d4906043022 1f41696c254c4a64972158eec8512688
#: 712a5dbc1fdd4d65b266144b39a6d578 936ed9b0bb9741afad9a060b7909e7a8
#: a04cf08a18874aca87cfa877738d5d96
msgid "Note the swapping of signals between autopilot and peripheral."
msgstr "注意飞控与外设之间信号的交叉连接。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flight-controller-io.rst:105
#: 2aeea6999db0436b8b8e5e93f6d147d2 6cc47c8a2b944478b5f456751981ce88
#: 7a11ec4cf49d47b384b73094e4a2fd5c d736aeb27d394146a0fce0a4a4043d51
#: fc578c391df6456199cf6a8c488ae126
msgid ""
"usually +5V and GND are provided in the connector. If it is a GPS/Compass "
"port, then the I2C signals will also be provided and attached to the same "
"named signals on the compass sub-module of a GPS/Compass module."
msgstr "连接器中通常提供 +5V 和 GND。如果是 GPS/罗盘端口，则还会提供 I2C 信号，连接到 GPS/罗盘模块内罗盘子模块的同名信号。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flight-controller-io.rst:109
#: 0cadb3abbed24cf59db8a012b55f18cf 14fcf57f478841adab038368a102c422
#: 1f656786ee724587a89cf4960a87f08e 95c212443bae4c5a9f6437d1fe4b9dfb
#: fba36e90b7974ce683e6c67d09d21d39
msgid "PMU"
msgstr "PMU"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flight-controller-io.rst:111
#: 4a8a314a2939409eb8332f81fccbc7f4 a7dd5a683f8f45cab7eef0c90660e132
#: c108b571cef245128f9b5f319c64869c df7449603fd44d4a8bfb5b6cdae4d841
#: ffe493d48afe400980d70ae7505a6542
msgid ""
"Most autopilots provide the means to attach to a Power Management Unit (PMU)"
" of some kind. These :ref:`units<common-powermodule-landingpage>` provide "
"any, or all, of the following:"
msgstr ""
"大多数飞控提供连接某种电源管理单元（PMU）的手段。这些 :ref:`单元<common-powermodule-landingpage>` "
"提供以下任一或全部功能："

#: ../../source/docs/common-flight-controller-io.rst:113
#: 341f30beb8534977a2a89b314bf26899 3c5accc00d5e4877b26ed57e2e42fd75
#: 499a97493a454404b70a6642c8d5a41b d23535eee5b44571b82876d9a07885aa
#: e7fc70f2ca79466898b300eca174a6b5
msgid "A regulated +5V supply for the autopilot from the flight battery"
msgstr "从飞行电池为飞控提供稳压 +5V 电源"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flight-controller-io.rst:114
#: 774edb4b43c54d36aa843bd2f807cbfb c484ee07fe6a4c2eb972b53d4f18fd3a
#: cbd594aa32d648fea83f660a929a2d6d cd2eeee7f2bf466c8fe31a24e2978dd8
#: d56a3b12dc0042b8bda5a8357dde667e
msgid "Monitoring of current from the flight battery"
msgstr "监测飞行电池的电流"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flight-controller-io.rst:115
#: a5efa5939f0a467cb28b60d46cf8c648 b38a58a4933e4f69990c248fb16eaf51
#: c5ef1bce38244ba98db080e555feeb84 c9198f45b1794823ae654407cc626ca9
#: e790f1c7403c45d7a41e9067370da85f
msgid "Monitoring of voltage from the flight battery"
msgstr "监测飞行电池的电压"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flight-controller-io.rst:120
#: 3e2bef18b699450ba606d7f260b4cce6 69543fafe4144308959204eb97469f89
#: 8d7568c6c2d74370974d369e7db15835 91a009d23480463e876a73e4ba5ad875
#: dee65c6306b9426ba9f3c30565bb8597
msgid "+5V: Regulated supply to autopilot"
msgstr "+5V：飞控稳压供电"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flight-controller-io.rst:121
#: 284137968aa74a4fb06bdd42203f7e1e 43418c7c8e4746d0b4cee5aeb284f821
#: 713ca6eada6c4bcb85f93a31a59824b0 8c1e1bb0994b46d193108b0c0a28e3d0
#: c4adbf0bf5ee4f9ea255cf7ccabe3d9a
msgid ""
"CUR: Current Monitor output. Usually, a 0-3.3v analog voltage represents the"
" current draw level"
msgstr "CUR：电流监测输出。通常以 0-3.3V 模拟电压表示电流大小"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flight-controller-io.rst:122
#: 06a104f9096046848d5f82796d2ce08b 07526dd55f9349f19af5e2f061027942
#: b31436a6de654153bc11381712a25919 d28d9b0d2b924c07b4f48e7d534ba160
#: f3a42b23aee44b929ef30b6a22798397
msgid ""
"VLT: Voltage Monitor output. Usually, a  0-3.3V analog voltage representing "
"battery voltage"
msgstr "VLT：电压监测输出。通常以 0-3.3V 模拟电压表示电池电压"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flight-controller-io.rst:123
#: a758e01ba1c140609cdc6e9f39a84e87 ad7d16e510574ad7bd2f6d6fb2339f06
#: c0717cc3fa604029847577364f6f5d35 e462fcece92244debb000e10299533cd
#: fd133daa8885491cacd1c70112efec2d
msgid "GND: Ground"
msgstr "GND：地"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flight-controller-io.rst:125
#: 850bfde6e1b849ef831348073925b425 b91b99b54f4644cbbf1087a22090b035
#: beafb3f730d944189c20349cc4512a7e c4d1c0290e084a028c6e9ae31c37a747
#: d63204a21db44318af8e50ecad7ad2d4
msgid ""
"Some \"smart\" battery/power monitors replace the CUR and VLT pins with I2C "
"signals to provide digital information on battery status."
msgstr "某些「智能」电池/电源监视器用I2C信号替代CUR和VLT引脚，以数字方式提供电池状态信息。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flight-controller-io.rst:127
#: 35476a36502242c68d4f1573822e6172 89ab5337bbd144ec8ec06b870a9fc029
#: 91b4b5517dbd42c4804ce5d7394467fe d126ff1909624cdd84504e5a38f194ec
#: fb9ada1ae7094751a1e747da2f9a613e
msgid ""
"Many board-style autopilots fully integrate the PMU as part of the board "
"with internal connections to the processor."
msgstr "许多板载式飞控将PMU完全集成在板上，通过内部连接与处理器相连。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flight-controller-io.rst:129
#: 5e0f948d52844694a855e78af00b9c19 7e8ecfde620743768279f37c9391e727
#: 7f038955236c42fa9b9288fb603bd30c b5bb89def2684a8091a4b25c6bd44d1d
#: fa866554027145e0a3b4dee4b11199cd
msgid ""
"In addition, many autopilots offer multiple PMU connections since ArduPilot "
"firmware versions 4.0 and later support up to 10 PMUs/Battery Monitors."
msgstr "此外，由于ArduPilot固件4.0及更高版本支持最多10个PMU/电池监视器，许多飞控提供多个PMU连接。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flight-controller-io.rst:132
#: 2fc0b978e095443db030ed4a3c33ba21 6d23d74e401e4546abf0d38a6ee1cbc1
#: 97ef8d7cc56f42468796b43d0200ff2f ea6a3d80373547baa747be826b9cd33c
#: eb30f7fc73dc4fc382f480ebc81e0668
msgid "RCIN"
msgstr "RCIN"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flight-controller-io.rst:134
#: 45ed0be7a204479e9b3da165c4f6f8af 664b5626b5f7443787c2008321b55a84
#: 7844bd21fdb1438b97de0ae31f7c0d04 dafa58a1bfdb42d59c2e190db1211250
#: f666212ef506425e89d3971e9c3312ab
msgid ""
"Input from the radio control receiver is input on this pin. Most serial RC "
"protocols (PPM, SBUS, DSM, etc.) are supported by ArduPilot and auto-"
"detected. In addition, some autopilots provide dedicated connectors for DSM "
"protocol satellite receivers which provide power to the receiver in addition"
" to the input signal."
msgstr ""
"遥控接收机的输入信号通过此引脚接入。ArduPilot支持大多数串行遥控协议（PPM、SBUS、DSM等）并自动检测。此外，部分飞控为DSM协议卫星接收机提供专用连接器，除输入信号外还为接收机供电。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flight-controller-io.rst:136
#: 2dfb6d6811b74bfe810b108b7625b493 61557a589471448aab607b6492fe953b
#: 6ad7ece15009462db9097383ebab8f38 82b5d33606cf46afabe8eda91c87cd9d
#: bbd2f1877941487cae21eae2d920559c
msgid ""
"As of firmware versions 4.0 and later, ArduPilot also allows an RC receiver "
"to be attached to any UART port."
msgstr "从固件4.0版本起，ArduPilot还允许将遥控接收机连接到任意UART端口，而不局限于专用的RCin或SBUS输入引脚。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flight-controller-io.rst:139
#: ../../source/docs/common-flight-controller-io.rst:141
#: 27b47ce406f343e4b22720aa2d1045d3 3f33b301b0a64350a783194ee89e3843
#: 61014cad0dbd42a99b0647f8a1d6811a 8e5da10c453843b0ae7160e85c7d953f
#: dd233739f64e4233b34b7babd9844c2e
msgid "MAIN/AUX/OUT"
msgstr "MAIN/AUX/OUT"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flight-controller-io.rst:141
#: ../../source/docs/common-flight-controller-io.rst:143
#: 5b5990b80e254278a81fa5fda5a2509f 867f15706084495aa7c7fd1e5ddaadb5
#: a34a42f55ef140c4b87f5e31fce4923c a878b8707b1741e698c05e5bf19e4488
#: b7ef6f00bb53404c82b6bbdfced6d225
msgid ""
"The primary outputs for controlling motors (via ESCs) and servos are "
"provided by these pins/connectors. They are labeled either as MAIN/AUX "
"outputs or just as OUTPUTs. These outputs provide the PWM or Dshot signals "
"for motor ESC or servo control of flight surfaces. They can also be "
"sometimes used as general purpose I/O pins for controlling relays, "
"parachutes, grippers, etc."
msgstr ""
"这些引脚/连接器提供控制电机（通过ESC）和舵机的主要输出。它们标注为MAIN/AUX输出或仅标注为OUTPUT。这些输出为电机ESC或舵机提供PWM或DShot信号。有时也可用作通用I/O引脚，控制继电器、降落伞、机械爪等。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flight-controller-io.rst:143
#: ../../source/docs/common-flight-controller-io.rst:145
#: 1dfeeeec887c49d0b48beed7598cfbf9 37825722c3a34da3bf16758adce87806
#: 86f6ba344ded48dfb434d92a2251bb4e ef9e789c87e240a98e2e7f1849f8a9c2
#: f3aaa966ecca4327881f149fa7314860
msgid ""
"Those controllers with MAIN/AUX output labels usually indicate that a IOMCU "
"co-processor is being employed. These provide outputs intended for use as "
"the motor/servo outputs and provide a redundant means of control via RC if "
"the main autopilot fails. The MAIN outputs come from this co-processor, "
"while the AUX designated outputs are controlled directly from the autopilot."
" Most board level autopilots do not use an IOMCU and have outputs only "
"labeled OUTPUTx or Mx."
msgstr ""
"带有MAIN/AUX输出标签的飞控通常表明使用了IOMCU协处理器。这些输出用于电机/舵机控制，并在主飞控失效时通过遥控提供冗余控制手段。MAIN输出来自协处理器，而AUX输出由飞控直接控制。大多数板级飞控不使用IOMCU，其输出仅标注为OUTPUTx或Mx。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flight-controller-io.rst:145
#: ../../source/docs/common-flight-controller-io.rst:147
#: 53bf1a05ede34104a5a314c02ec78882 8c634adebd02451f9fbecd8363161e91
#: 9527c6b169b84b4abc0f8b3d35d3aaf5 d923d15b04464488958a42bfbd4b1dd5
#: ed501aac25744523b3f57a743f6db260
msgid ""
"This distinction is important since AUX outputs(and OUTPUTs from autopilots "
"without an IOMCU) can be used as GPIOs as well as PWM or Dshot. While MAIN "
"outputs can only be used for PWM, except for use as RELAY GPIOs. See "
":ref:`GPIOs <common-gpios>`"
msgstr ""
"这一区别很重要，因为AUX输出（以及无IOMCU飞控的OUTPUT）可用作GPIO，也可用作PWM或DShot。而MAIN输出只能用于PWM，但可用作RELAY"
" GPIO。参见 :ref:`GPIO <common-gpios>`"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flight-controller-io.rst:147
#: ../../source/docs/common-flight-controller-io.rst:149
#: 6d8f224976f8460fa004fd110e134770 883d24356be842e385ad09180ec3a143
#: a8b7249afdec4a26b61915104beedee5 c9fd56ed2ff54f3e906e2757bac9b07f
#: d660b609c95043bdb8e18784fbfc9b99
msgid ""
"A few autopilots that do NOT use an IOMCU label their outputs as MAIN, so "
"actually do have the capability of use as GPIOs and/or Dshot ESC control on "
"these outputs. CUAV V5 Nano and Holybro Pixhawk 4 Mini are examples."
msgstr ""
"少数不使用IOMCU的飞控将其输出标注为MAIN，实际上这些输出具备GPIO和/或DShot ESC控制能力。CUAV V5 Nano和Holybro "
"Pixhawk 4 Mini就是典型例子。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flight-controller-io.rst:149
#: ../../source/docs/common-flight-controller-io.rst:151
#: 036b9c608956445181d9e833bf591fac 0f6d965d6f334e1b9b5daea1eb651c8b
#: 65b906ab3b6a4db4b09e3be1f701e446 dc554d952cce4a5caa028070bc52646a
#: fe9439cf6ae14115aa3edebddf802fb3
msgid ""
"Often these outputs are provided on 3-pin connector strips supplying or "
"distributing servo power and ground, in addition to the individual output "
"signals. This power is usually provided externally, such as by the ESC or a "
"BEC, although some autopilots provide this power from internal regulators."
msgstr ""
"这些输出通常通过3针连接器排提供，分配舵机电源和地线，并提供各自的输出信号。电源通常由外部供给，例如由ESC或BEC提供，但部分飞控通过内部稳压器供电。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flight-controller-io.rst:152
#: ../../source/docs/common-flight-controller-io.rst:154
#: 53ec772dfe6944e892ed14e144fbcd3c 5ab0a06dc2a54f5aaabc324949f22297
#: 70c2b2f411de49b0892114388b07068b c4f0cb79b4a54daa81727258b210ae9f
#: e98b66d5354347c6ad5682317160fe67
msgid "CAN"
msgstr "CAN"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flight-controller-io.rst:154
#: ../../source/docs/common-flight-controller-io.rst:156
#: 2a5b8f8831eb4478895d37b4710909c5 59ea577beeb5487b9e1f2682a5622cc7
#: be68b10b7b69488da143f04cccc23bbc cb86e2a0378247078b5f481506bbde1f
#: f0f0f47bfe0b4fa08177e2652e1c121c
msgid ""
":ref:`CAN <common-canbus-setup-advanced>` bus is provided on many autopilots"
" for use with :ref:`DroneCAN <common-uavcan-setup-advanced>` peripherals. "
"ESCs, GPS/Compass, Rangefinders, and many other peripherals and sensors are "
"being added to the list of available DroneCAN devices every day. CAN "
"provides a robust method of communicating with peripherals with data "
"integrity, even with long leads."
msgstr ""
":ref:`CAN <common-canbus-setup-advanced>` 总线在许多飞控上可用，用于连接 :ref:`DroneCAN "
"<common-uavcan-setup-advanced>` "
"外设。ESC、GPS/罗盘、测距仪以及许多其他外设和传感器正不断加入DroneCAN设备列表。CAN即使在导线较长的情况下也能以数据完整性保障与外设可靠通信。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flight-controller-io.rst:160
#: ../../source/docs/common-flight-controller-io.rst:162
#: 3905f9aa9dbd49a2a6f291d4c5d09496 5d4447cb293e46eeafcac90db4b4e74e
#: c510b8940b7643afa10b967e0e082972 d000e7e296f8415ca7f4a4917d0f927b
#: da2f89d68d40419fa29e54f807d94c9e
msgid "CAN_H: CAN high side signal, connects to peripherals CAN_H pin"
msgstr "CAN_H：CAN高侧信号，连接外设的CAN_H引脚"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flight-controller-io.rst:161
#: ../../source/docs/common-flight-controller-io.rst:163
#: 54b657d8d9da48bbacb46261fa61ffce 5dcb05cbb3da45c3958843503c2b8683
#: 82bd956b69164f9d97a197e19ede20c5 c208c37968014e90b66606214d091944
#: fdbef0d8a35543c890532d387f48aefa
msgid "CAN_L: CAN low side signal, connects to peripherals CAN_L pin"
msgstr "CAN_L：CAN低侧信号，连接外设的CAN_L引脚"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flight-controller-io.rst:163
#: ../../source/docs/common-flight-controller-io.rst:165
#: 266509d6083e4a58bbbc0c8efc84ce85 30862d2a537a4d028c115ca018a6b6c2
#: 32cdbfd7dfaf426db9496dc5f2a4992f 61dca8324d254aaeb90ca721b25a474b
#: 7da733398f7c4bcca3ae8ea63b02556e
msgid ""
"Power and ground are usually also provided on a standard 4-pin JST-GH "
"connector."
msgstr "电源和地线通常也通过标准4针JST-GH连接器提供。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flight-controller-io.rst:166
#: ../../source/docs/common-flight-controller-io.rst:168
#: 470478fa14b347599e5e05612a51ea04 5f1541636fc8439f89d812846c8b31f8
