#: a5350adae1d54e01a6cca460e88ea884
msgid ""
"Often analog voltage measurement pins are provided. These are used for "
"current and/or voltage sensing from a power monitor (if a dedicated "
"connector has not been provided), other system voltage monitor points, or "
"for analog :ref:`RSSI<common-rssi-received-signal-strength-indication>` "
"input."
msgstr ""
"通常提供模拟电压测量引脚。这些引脚用于来自电源监视器的电流和/或电压检测（如果未提供专用连接器）、其他系统电压监测点，或模拟 "
":ref:`RSSI<common-rssi-received-signal-strength-indication>` 输入。"
